ResidentConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
EmployeeConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
TaskListConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
RefreshTokenConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
MedicineRecordConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
PainkillerRecordConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
ResidentNoteConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
ChangeDetailConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
SubjectAccessRequestConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
LoginAttemptConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization
RetentionPolicyConfiguration ..> IEntityTypeConfiguration : realization

