EmployeeConfiguration --> Employee : seeds
TaskListConfiguration --> TaskList : seeds
MedicineRecordConfiguration --> MedicineRecord : seeds
ResidentNoteConfiguration --> ResidentNote : seeds
RetentionPolicyConfiguration --> RetentionPolicy : seeds
ChangeDetailConfiguration --> AuditEntry : relates
SubjectAccessRequestConfiguration --> SubjectAccessRequest : configures
LoginAttemptConfiguration --> LoginAttempt : configures
RefreshTokenConfiguration --> RefreshToken : configures
PainkillerRecordConfiguration --> PainkillerRecord : configures
